dense  : Phi = expm(A_aug h) once (Pade 13, scaling and squaring), then Phi x per step (n^2)
action : expm_multiply(A_aug h, x) per step (truncated Taylor, ~||A h||_1 matvecs, sparse)
implicit: one sparse LU of (I - h/2 A) once, trapezoid step = 1 solve (2nd order, NOT exact) -- the hand-over
